{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_83_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_83","textTraditional":"一、二十年，春，新作南門。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_83_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_83","textTraditional":"何以書？譏。何譏爾？門有古常也。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_83_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_83","textTraditional":"二、夏，郜子來朝。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_83_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_83","textTraditional":"郜子者何？失地之君也。何以不名？兄弟辭也。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_83_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_83","textTraditional":"三、五月乙巳，西宮災。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_83_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_83","textTraditional":"西宮者何？小寢也。小寢則曷為謂之西宮？有西宮則有東宮矣。魯子曰：「以有西宮，亦知諸侯之有三宮也。」西宮災何以書？記異也。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_cdt_83_7","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_83","textTraditional":"四、鄭人入滑。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_cdt_83_8","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_83","textTraditional":"五、秋，齊人、狄人盟于邢。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_cdt_83_9","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_83","textTraditional":"六、冬，楚人伐隨。","sentenceOrder":9}],"overrides":{}}